                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <div>48.200 MT (964 Bags)</div>
                        <div class="text-muted small">PKR 162.00 / Kg &bull; Freight: PKR 72,000 | Net: PKR 7,808,400</div>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <span class="text-success small fw-medium"><i class="bi bi-check2"></i> 0.000 MT Delta</span>
